[Trigger]
Name	wind
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Dunmarrow is a sea of sand over old barrows, master. Warden Ysolde Dunn has seen your banners and is packing her camp in the far north-west. Catch her before she is gone.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Ysolde Dunn before she escapes through the old shaft.
Action	objective	1	Find the old tunnels under the dunes.
Action	order	wait	2	-	YsoldeDunn
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	southCrossed
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthDunes
Action	message	1	The old tunnels run under these dunes. They are narrow and straight, a good place for traps.
Action	reveal	1	Oasis
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	oasisFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Oasis
Action	message	1	Fresh water. A tomb door in the east has stood open for a long time, and the hall behind it looks cut for a creature, not a corpse.
Action	spawn	1	66	112	1	Orc:2	Goblin:2
Action	reveal	1	Barrows
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	barrowsEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Barrows
Action	message	1	The central barrows are wide open under the sand. Her scouts have been through here.
Action	reveal	1	Tomb
Action	reveal	1	HighDunes
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	tombOpened
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Tomb
Action	message	1	The tomb is empty but for the old dead. Their keepers left a store of gold behind.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	highDunes
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	HighDunes
Action	message	1	From these dunes you can see her camp. The wagons are loaded and she is leaving within the quarter hour!
Action	spawn	2	50	38	1	Knight:2	Elf:2	Adventurer:2	Monk:2
Action	reveal	1	NorthDunes
Action	objective	1	Reach the camp before the wagons leave.
Action	setflag	wagons	1
Action	timer	wagonClock	0
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	campSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthDunes
Action	message	1	The camp gate is in sight. Her last guards are forming up on the ramp, and the gate swings open.
Action	spawn	2	18	18	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2
Action	terrain	14	21	15	21	path
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	campEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Camp
Action	message	1	You are in the camp. Dunn is somewhere between the tents and her wagon.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	shaftFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	ShaftHead
Action	message	1	An old shaft head leans out of the sand. It leads to the camp by a shorter way than the road.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sandwave1
Mode	once
Cond	time	300
Action	message	1	A column of riders is coming over the southern dunes.
Action	spawn	2	40	110	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sandwave2
Mode	once
Cond	time	820
Action	message	1	Hunters are coming out of the west gully.
Action	spawn	2	14	98	1	Knight:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sandwave3
Mode	once
Cond	time	1400
Action	message	1	A company from the oasis is marching on your heart.
Action	spawn	2	50	93	1	Knight:3	Elf:2	Dwarf2:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	sandwave4
Mode	once
Cond	time	2000
Action	message	1	Dunn has thrown her reserves into the south.
Action	spawn	2	40	110	1	Knight:3	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wagonLeaves
Mode	once
Cond	flag	wagons	1
Cond	timer	wagonClock	>=	900
Cond	alive	YsoldeDunn
Action	message	1	The wagons are rolling! Dunn is running for the old shaft. Cut her off.
Action	terrain	14	21	15	21	path
Action	order	goto	2	16,12;14,19;14,22;12,26;11,31;10,36;10,42;12,47;16,49;18,51;17,53	YsoldeDunn
Action	speed	run	YsoldeDunn
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenEscaped
Mode	once
Cond	reached	YsoldeDunn	region	ExitShaft
Action	message	1	Dunn has slipped down the old shaft and her wagons are gone. Dunmarrow is lost.
Action	lose	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenCaught
Mode	once
Cond	event	YsoldeDunn	killed
Action	message	1	Ysolde Dunn is dead in the sand and her wagons are still. Dunmarrow is yours.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	oasisHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Oasis	40
Action	message	1	The oasis is ours. A wandering spider has smelled the water and comes to serve you.
Action	generate	1	Spider:1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
